{"id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-grothendieck-total-category.md","title":"带相干性的总范畴重建","display":"df-grothendieck-total-category — 带相干性的总范畴重建","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-grothendieck-total-category","aliases":["16-df-grothendieck-total-category","Grothendieck total category of a fibration","16-comprehension-category"],"display":"df-grothendieck-total-category — 带相干性的总范畴重建","depends_on":["[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Lemma 1.4.10, p. 54 (PDF 74); Definition 1.10.1 and Proposition 1.10.2(ii), pp. 107–108 (PDF 127–128)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-grothendieck-total-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-grothendieck-total-category</span><span>Grothendieck total category of a fibration</span><span>16-comprehension-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-grothendieck-total-category — 带相干性的总范畴重建"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 1.4.10, p. 54 (PDF 74); Definition 1.10.1 and Proposition 1.10.2(ii), pp. 107–108 (PDF 127–128)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_{I,X}\">\\(i_{I,X}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{u,v,Z}\">\\(c_{u,v,Z}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,X)\">\\(A=(I,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,Y)\">\\(B=(J,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(K,Z)\">\\(C=(K,Z)\\)</span> 为下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_p\">\\(O_p\\)</span> 的对象；箭头记录携带源、靶标签，源靶固定时将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\)</span> 简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,f):A\\to B\">\\((u,f):A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为下文构造的函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 的参数顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\">\\((F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\},\\\\\nM_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_p\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,u^*Y)\\},\\\\\ns_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_p(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,i_{I,X}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_p(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,c_{u,v,Z}\\circ u^*g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_p,M_p,s_p,t_p,e_p,c_p\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\},\\\\\nM_p&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_p\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,u^*Y)\\},\\\\\ns_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_p(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,i_{I,X}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_p(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,c_{u,v,Z}\\circ u^*g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_p,M_p,s_p,t_p,e_p,c_p\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nK(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad K\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y)\\circ f,\\\\\nL(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(pX,X),\\\\\n\\{\\widehat h\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_{pX}}(X,(ph)^*Y)\n\\mid\\kappa(ph,Y)\\circ f=h\\}\\quad(h:X\\to Y),\\\\\nL(h:X\\to Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(pX,X),(pY,Y),ph,\\widehat h\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(K,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa),\\mathcal E),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(L,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)),\\\\\nKL&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E},\n\\qquad LK=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nK(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad K\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y)\\circ f,\\\\\nL(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(pX,X),\\\\\n\\{\\widehat h\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_{pX}}(X,(ph)^*Y)\n\\mid\\kappa(ph,Y)\\circ f=h\\}\\quad(h:X\\to Y),\\\\\nL(h:X\\to Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(pX,X),(pY,Y),ph,\\widehat h\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(K,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa),\\mathcal E),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(L,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)),\\\\\nKL&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E},\n\\qquad LK=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 唯一分解为选定的笛卡尔提升后接垂直箭头，故定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat h\">\\(\\widehat h\\)</span> 的集合恰为单元素，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L\">\\(K,L\\)</span> 在对象和箭头上互逆。规范 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,c\">\\(i,c\\)</span> 的定义使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 保持单位与复合；由其单射性，范畴公理从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 反映到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>所有单位与复合的相干数据已有形式来源；未分裂的 cleavage 必须保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,c\">\\(i,c\\)</span>。原先的英文 <code>in</code> 已改为精确的纤维 Hom 域。</li>\n<li>历史文件名不代表理解范畴；理解范畴的正式定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的旧上下文中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C(p)\">\\(\\mathbf C(p)\\)</span> 可简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Lemma 1.4.10, p. 54（PDF 74）；Definition 1.10.1、Proposition 1.10.2(ii), pp. 107–108（PDF 127–128）。本地标签编码使这里的重建给出明确范畴同构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$。$u^*$、$i_{I,X}$、$c_{u,v,Z}$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]、[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$。$u^*$、$i_{I,X}$、$c_{u,v,Z}$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]、[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]；$K$ 与 $L$ 为下文构造的函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的参数顺序 $(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"历史文件名不代表理解范畴；理解范畴的正式定义见 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。在固定 $\\kappa$ 的旧上下文中 $\\mathbf C(p)$ 可简写 $\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"i_{I,X}","display":false},{"tex":"c_{u,v,Z}","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"C=(K,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"O_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(u,f):A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_p&\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\n\\land X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\},\\\\\nM_p&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid\nA=(I,X)\\in O_p\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O_p\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,u^*Y)\\},\\\\\ns_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t_p\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne_p(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,i_{I,X}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_p(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,c_{u,v,Z}\\circ u^*g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)&\\coloneqq\\langle O_p,M_p,s_p,t_p,e_p,c_p\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nK(I,X)&\\coloneqq X,\n\\qquad K\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y)\\circ f,\\\\\nL(X)&\\coloneqq(pX,X),\\\\\n\\{\\widehat h\\}&\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_{pX}}(X,(ph)^*Y)\n\\mid\\kappa(ph,Y)\\circ f=h\\}\\quad(h:X\\to Y),\\\\\nL(h:X\\to Y)&\\coloneqq\\langle(pX,X),(pY,Y),ph,\\widehat h\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(K,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa),\\mathcal E),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(L,\\mathcal E,\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)),\\\\\nKL&=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E},\n\\qquad LK=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat h","display":false},{"tex":"K,L","display":false},{"tex":"i,c","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"i,c","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":3367,"backlinks":[{"id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.4.4(ii), p. 51（PDF 71）；Definition 1.10.1、Proposition 1.10.2(i), pp. 107–108（PDF 127–128）的严格情形。一般非严格 cleavage 的版本见 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]。"},{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]，$T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)$ 采用 [[16-thm-grothendieck]]；两者分别用于末行自然同构的分量。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-total-category|df-grothendieck-total-category — 带相干性的总范畴重建]]"}],"outgoing":["fc49efccd7348d66","4ea27d39c2af987b","f12a7a1ec4908770","298460dd9013dccf","25a281534aa42440","0ba8f021ca287877"]}